  "who_and_when": "For the retro-enthusiast craving unironic, testosterone-fueled nostalgia and the simple joy of watching giant robots smash things. Perfect for lazy weekend mornings.",
  "emotional_evocation": "Evokes a raw, childlike hype and fist-pumping excitement, leaving the viewer with a simple, satisfied grin of nostalgic bliss."
