'@

    "efbce936-e759-4726-8ef7-dc98916f72eb" = @'
{
  "metadata_synthesis": "A 1969 Japanese experimental art film directed by Katsu Kanai, deeply entrenched in the radical, avant-garde cinematic movement reacting to post-war American influence and domestic turmoil.",
